%% Challenge submission and verification sequence (UML sequence, informal)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Member
  participant App as App (proof module)
  participant ST as Cloud Storage
  participant FS as Firestore
  participant FN as Functions
  actor R as Reviewer
  M->>App: Choose tier (standard/foundation) or approved alternate
  M->>App: Record video with in-app camera
  App->>App: save to app-private storage + local proof record
  App->>FS: create attempt (uid, tier, value, performedAt) - rules check window by request.time
  App->>ST: resumable upload proof/gid/sid/cid/uid/attemptId/file
  ST->>ST: rules: owner path, size, type, active member
  App->>FS: attach proofIds to attempt (owner, status submitted)
  FS->>FN: onAttemptWritten
  FN->>FS: set status in_review if proofPolicy required or sampled
  R->>FN: getProofPlaybackUrl(attemptId)
  FN->>FN: check reviewer role, audit log
  FN-->>R: signed URL valid 15 min or less
  R->>FN: reviewAttempt(approve or reject, reason)
  FN->>FS: reviews/*, status approved
  FN->>FS: ledger create-if-absent, recompute standings
